sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant IoT as IoT Devices (Falcon/SMAC)
    participant TS as Colbits TimescaleDB (read-only)
    participant BE as Backend API & Fault Engine
    participant PD as Platform DB (our tables)
    participant FE as React Frontend
    actor Op as Operator
    IoT->>TS: Stream telemetry & fuse events (existing Colbits pipeline)
    loop Background processing (every few seconds)
        BE->>TS: Poll new events & last timestamps (SELECT only)
        BE->>BE: Group openings per fuse set (< 5 min window) & flag inactivity
        BE->>PD: Upsert active faults, inactivity alarms & affected clients
    end
    Op->>FE: Request 30-day history for Circuit X
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/analytics (Bearer JWT)
    BE->>BE: Validate token & scope boundary
    BE->>TS: Query time-series aggregates (scoped)
    BE->>PD: Read fault history for same scope
    BE-->>FE: Historical dataset + indicators
    FE->>Op: Render interactive trend charts
    Op->>FE: Click "Export PDF / XLSX"
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/reports/generate
    BE->>BE: Compute indicators server-side & add traceability header
    BE-->>FE: Stream compiled file
    FE->>Op: Download document
